":4090,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":20,"position":20,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3672605384","pull_request_review_id":4806103650,"id":3672605384,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7a54LI","diff_hunk":"@@ -803,7 +803,7 @@ void EditorNode3DGizmo::create() {\n \n \tbvh_node_id = Node3DEditor::get_singleton()->insert_gizmo_bvh_node(\n \t\t\tspatial_node,\n-\t\t\tAABB(spatial_node->get_position(), Vector3(0, 0, 0)));\n+\t\t\tAABB(spatial_node->get_global_position(), Vector3(0, 0, 0)));","path":"editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_gizmos.cpp","commit_id":"87e549cee03efc0e1af1880b11194ec362032bf8","original_commit_id":"87e549cee03efc0e1af1880b11194ec362032bf8","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Gizmos are deferred requested when a node enters the `world` and clears the gizmo when the node leaves the `world`.\r\n\r\nNow having a `world` and being in the actual scene `tree` is not the same thing.\r\n\r\nTechnically it is possible to be in a `world` but not in the scene `tree`.\r\n\r\nIn practice it does not really happen because no one  really assigns a `world` manually for a node.\r\nThey all get their `world` from `enter tree` events or leave their `world` from an `exit tree` event.\r\n\r\nWhat saves this from burning is the deferred call so if anyone would dare to flush the deferred queue between removing a node from the scene `tree` and before the `world` enter / exit notification is send it explodes.\r\n\r\nIt is a more core issue so I don't think this PR needs to bother with that old c.","created_at":"2026-07-29T09:03:11Z","updated_at":"2026-07-29T09:08:04Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121879#discussion_r3672605384","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121879","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3672605384"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121879#discussion_r3672605384"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121879"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3672605384/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":1,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":806,"original_line":806,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":3671760999,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":29,"position":29,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3675717499","pull_request_review_id":4810020233,"id":3675717499,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7bFv97","diff_hunk":"@@ -4079,7 +4087,7 @@ DynamicBVH::ID Node3DEditor::insert_gizmo_bvh_node(Node3D *p_node, const AABB &p\n \n void Node3DEditor::update_gizmo_bvh_node(DynamicBVH::ID p_id, const AABB &p_aabb) {\n \tgizmo_bvh.update(p_id, p_aabb);\n-\tgizmo_bvh.optimize_incremental(1);\n+\tgizmo_bvh_needs_optimization = true;","path":"editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp","commit_id":"87e549cee03efc0e1af1880b